          "list": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A laser musket can accept one each of the following mods:</span> </p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><strong>Capacitor:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.lFsiNavPBMySy8aC]{Three-Crank Capacitor}</span>, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.5ec9hyRDheaj7XBr]{Four-Crank Capacitor}<span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aU7O4Z0LZlfkQySH]{Five-Crank Capacitor}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.KAB50kt6NdZERpb6]{Six-Crank Capacitor}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Barrel:</span></strong> <span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6py6TtlkeywhWQl1]{Long Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.ixQH2KupAncBBDnJ]{Bracketed Short Barrel}</span>, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.EAlWnJTq1UhpNQ7n]{Bracketed Long Barrel}</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Stock:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.ryaBZCITyZP3DoOP]{Full Stock}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Sights:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WZAnlfreDNUAaX4Y]{Reflex Sight}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.9IW2T8sgBoIzzxn8]{Short Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.0mBcFGCDPdhVRPsP]{Long Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aQLTpQYLnuRen9xP]{Short Night Vision Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.HXoyLcCUhPOtbnse]{Long Night Vision Scope}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.K8ZOSxg9heUurjsM]{Recon Scope}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Muzzle: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.yUZZMAoSuAyyyryF]{Beam Splitter Muzzle}</span>, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.iBg22gDv2OpisVJc]{Beam Focuser Muzzle}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.4WQWCeA24aFZBsd3]{Gyro Compensating Lens}